{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38059","headline":"寄隐者 · 韩偓","name":"寄隐者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟郭云扃路不遥，怀贤犹恨太迢迢。\n长松夜落钗千股，小港春添水半腰。\n已约病身抛印绶，不嫌门巷似渔樵。\n渭滨晦迹南阳卧，若比吾徒更寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}